<title>GERMANY: Plettac buys Grundig division.</title>
<headline>Plettac buys Grundig division.</headline>
<dateline>PLETTENBERG, Germany 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Plettac AG said on Sunday it had bought the video and security systems business of consumer electronics company Grundig AG, with backdated effect from January 1.</p>
<p>The two companies had signed an agreement following a letter of intent to which they had agreed last December, Plettac said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Grundig division generates sales of about 120 million marks per year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
